WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes. A recording. A promise to sharpen your attention.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A perceived beat is an observation. A brainwave change is a second claim.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A measurable improvement in your work is a third—and harder—question.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Studies disagree. The recordings sold online were not those studies.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try a free twelve-minute baseline before paying for an explanation.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
The source should outlast the promise. Final Vestige: examine the evidence.
